(158, 'Sidecar', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all ingredients into cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake well and strain into cocktail glass.', 'Cognac, Cointreau, Lemon juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(159, 'Sazerac', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Rinse a chilled old-fashioned glass with the absinthe, add crushed ice, and set it aside. Stir the remaining ingredients over ice and set it aside. Discard the ice and any excess absinthe from the prepared glass, and strain the drink into the glass. Add the lemon peel for garnish.', 'Ricard, Sugar, Peychaud bitters, Water, Bourbon, Lemon peel', 'Fumé, sucré'),
(160, 'Acapulco', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Combine and shake all ingredients (except mint) with ice and strain into an old-fashioned glass over ice cubes. Add the sprig of mint and serve.', 'Light rum, Triple sec, Lime juice, Sugar, Egg white, Mint', 'Acide, sucré'),
(161, 'Ice Pick', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Put Vodka in glass fill with iced tea. Stir in lemon to taste.', 'Vodka, Iced tea, Lemon juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(162, 'Applecar', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Applejack, Triple sec, Lemon juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(163, 'Spice 75', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Gently warm 60g golden caster sugar in a pan with 30ml water and 1 tbsp allspice. Cook gently until the sugar has dissolved, then leave the mixture to cool. Strain through a sieve lined with a coffee filter (or a double layer of kitchen paper).\n\nPour 60ml of the spiced syrup into a cocktail shaker along with 200ml rum and 90ml lime juice. Shake with ice and strain between six flute glasses. Top up with 600ml champagne and garnish each with an orange twist.', 'Sugar, Allspice, Rum, Lime Juice, Champagne, Orange spiral', 'Acide, sucré'),
(164, 'Godchild', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients well with cracked ice, strain into a champagne flute, and serve.', 'Vodka, Amaretto, Heavy cream', 'Fruité'),
(165, 'Buccaneer', 'Beer', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour the corona into an 18oz beer glass pour the bacardi limon into the beer stir very gently', 'Corona, Bacardi Limon', 'Fruité'),
(166, 'Applejack', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Add all ingredients into mixing glass, chill and strain into cocktail glass', 'Jack Daniels, Midori melon liqueur, Sour mix', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(167, 'Old Cuban', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake a handful of mint, 2oz white rum, 1oz of sugar syrup, 1oz lime juice and 2 dashes angostura bitters with ice. Double strain into a glass and top with 2oz of prosecco.', 'White Rum, Sugar Syrup, Lime Juice, Angostura Bitters, Prosecco', 'Acide, sucré'),
(168, 'Americano', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour the Campari and vermouth over ice into glass, add a splash of soda water and garnish with half orange slice.', 'Campari, Sweet Vermouth, Lemon peel, Orange peel', 'Amer, sucré'),
(169, 'Pegu Club', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake, strain, up, cocktail glass', 'Gin, Orange Curacao, Lime Juice, Angostura Bitters, Orange Bitters', 'Acide, sucré'),
(170, 'Barracuda', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake pour ingredients with ice. Strain into glass, top with Sparkling wine.', 'Rum, Galliano, Pineapple Juice, Lime Juice, Prosecco', 'Acide, sucré'),
(171, 'French 75', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Combine gin, sugar, and lemon juice in a cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake vigorously and strain into a chilled champagne glass. Top up with Champagne. Stir gently.', 'Gin, Sugar, Lemon juice, Champagne, Orange, Maraschino cherry', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(172, 'Egg Cream', 'Other / Unknown', 'Non alcoholic', 'Mix syrup and milk in a fountain glass. Add soda water, serve with a straw.', 'Chocolate syrup, Milk, Soda water', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(173, 'Michelada', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix the beer with tomato juice, freshly squeezed lime juice, and Worcestershire sauce, teriyaki sauce, soy sauce, or hot sauce.\r\nServed In a chilled, salt-rimmed glass\r\n', 'Beer, Tomato Juice, Lime Juice, Hot Sauce, Worcestershire Sauce, Soy Sauce', 'Acide, sucré, salé'),
(174, 'Avalanche', 'Shake', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix in highball glass over ice, shake well.', 'Crown Royal, Kahlua, Cream', 'Fruité'),
(175, 'Rum Punch', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix all ingredients in a punch bowl and serve.', 'Rum, Ginger ale, Fruit punch, Orange juice, Ice', 'Fruité, épicé, sucré, épicé'),
(176, 'H.D.', 'Coffee / Tea', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix the whisky and Baileys Cream in a beer-glass (at least 50 cl). Fill the rest of the glass with coffee.', 'Whisky, Baileys irish cream, Coffee', 'Crémeux'),
