(179, 'Derby', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all ingredients into a mixing glass with ice. Stir. Strain into a cocktail glass. Garnish with a sprig of fresh mint in the drink.', 'gin, Peach Bitters, Mint', 'Fruité'),
(180, 'Diesel', 'Beer', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour the lager first then add the blackcurrant cordial. Top up with the cider. The colour sholud be very dark approaching the colour of Guiness.', 'Lager, Cider, Blackcurrant cordial', 'Fruité'),
(181, 'Radler', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour beer into large mug, slowly add the 7-up (or Sprite).', 'Beer, 7-Up', 'Fruité'),
(182, 'Snowday', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Stir all ingredients with ice. Strain into a chilled rocks glass over fresh ice. Express orange peel over drink and garnish.', 'Vodka, Amaro Montenegro, Ruby Port, Blood Orange, Angostura Bitters, Orange Peel', 'Amer'),
(183, 'Limeade', 'Other / Unknown', 'Non alcoholic', 'In a large glass, put the lime juice and sugar, and stir well. Add cold seltzer water to fill. Put the lime peels in the glass. Drink. Repeat until limes or soda run out.', 'Lime, Sugar, Soda water, Lime peel', 'Acide, sucré'),
(184, 'Sidecar', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all ingredients into cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake well and strain into cocktail glass.', 'Cognac, Cointreau, Lemon juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(185, 'Addison', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake together all the ingredients and strain into a cold glass.', 'Gin, Vermouth', 'Amer'),
(186, 'Old Pal', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Chill cocktail glass. Add ingredients to a mixing glass, and fill 2/3 full with ice. Stir about 20 seconds. Empty cocktail glass and strain into the glass. Garnish with a twist of lemon peel.', 'Rye whiskey, Campari, Dry Vermouth', 'Amer'),
