(190, 'Bluebird', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a mixing glass half-filled with crushed ice, combine the gin, triple sec, Curacao, and bitters. Stir well. Strain into a cocktail glass and garnish with the lemon twist and the cherry.', 'Gin, Triple sec, Blue Curacao, Bitters, Maraschino cherry, Lemon peel', 'Fruité'),
