(766, 'B-52', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'Layer ingredients into a shot glass. Serve with a stirrer.', 'Baileys irish cream, Grand Marnier, Kahlua', 'Crémeux'),
(767, 'Derby', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all ingredients into a mixing glass with ice. Stir. Strain into a cocktail glass. Garnish with a sprig of fresh mint in the drink.', 'gin, Peach Bitters, Mint', 'Fruité'),
