(1167, 'Zorro', 'Coffee / Tea', 'Alcoholic', 'add all and pour black coffee and add whipped cream on top.', 'Sambuca, Baileys irish cream, White Creme de Menthe', 'Herbacé'),
(1168, 'Karsk', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Put a copper coin in a coffe-cup and fill up with coffee until you no longer see the coin, then add alcohol until you see the coin. Norwegian speciality.', 'Coffee, Grain alcohol', 'Fruité'),
(1169, 'Affair', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour schnapps, orange juice, and cranberry juice over ice in a highball glass. Top with club soda and serve.', 'Strawberry schnapps, Orange juice, Cranberry juice, Club soda', 'Fruité, sucré'),
