(1173, 'Zinger', 'Soft Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Get a shot glass and pour in three shots of the schnapps. Do the same with the Surge Cola. Then down it like Scheetz would.', 'Peachtree schnapps, Surge', 'Fruité'),
