(1192, 'Zoksel', 'Soft Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'No specific mixing instructions, just poor every ingredient in one glass. The lemon goes with it.', 'Beer, Root beer, Lemonade, Coca-Cola, 7-Up, Creme de Cassis, Lemon', 'Crémeux'),
(1193, 'Diesel', 'Beer', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour the lager first then add the blackcurrant cordial. Top up with the cider. The colour sholud be very dark approaching the colour of Guiness.', 'Lager, Cider, Blackcurrant cordial', 'Fruité'),
(1194, 'Mimosa', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Ensure both ingredients are well chilled, then mix into the glass. Serve cold.', 'Champagne, Orange juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1195, 'Frosé', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Step 1\nPour rosé into a 13x9\" pan and freeze until almost solid (it won\'t completely solidify due to the alcohol), at least 6 hours.\n\nStep 2\nMeanwhile, bring sugar and ½ cup water to a boil in a medium saucepan; cook, stirring constantly, until sugar dissolves, about 3 minutes. Add strawberries, remove from heat, and let sit 30 minutes to infuse syrup with strawberry flavor. Strain through a fine-mesh sieve into a small bowl (do not press on solids); cover and chill until cold, about 30 minutes.\n\nStep 3\nScrape rosé into a blender. Add lemon juice, 3½ ounces strawberry syrup, and 1 cup crushed ice and purée until smooth. Transfer blender jar to freezer and freeze until frosé is thickened (aim for milkshake consistency), 25–35 minutes.\n\nStep 4\nBlend again until frosé is slushy. Divide among glasses.\n\nStep 5\nDo Ahead: Rosé can be frozen 1 week ahead.', 'Rose, Sugar, Strawberries, Lemon Juice', 'Floral, sucré'),
(1196, 'Casino', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all ingredients into shaker with ice cubes. Shake well. Strain into chilled cocktail glass. Garnish with a lemon twist and a maraschino cherry. Serve without a straw.', 'Gin, Maraschino liqueur, Lemon juice, Orange bitters, Cherry', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1197, 'Orgasm', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into a chilled cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Creme de Cacao, Amaretto, Triple sec, Vodka, Light cream', 'Crémeux'),
(1198, 'Spritz', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Build into glass over ice, garnish and serve.', 'Prosecco, Campari, Soda Water', 'Amer'),
(1199, 'Vesper', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake over ice until well chilled, then strain into a deep goblet and garnish with a thin slice of lemon peel.', 'Gin, Vodka, Lillet Blanc', 'Fruité'),
(1200, 'Snowday', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Stir all ingredients with ice. Strain into a chilled rocks glass over fresh ice. Express orange peel over drink and garnish.', 'Vodka, Amaro Montenegro, Ruby Port, Blood Orange, Angostura Bitters, Orange Peel', 'Amer'),
(1201, 'Sazerac', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Rinse a chilled old-fashioned glass with the absinthe, add crushed ice, and set it aside. Stir the remaining ingredients over ice and set it aside. Discard the ice and any excess absinthe from the prepared glass, and strain the drink into the glass. Add the lemon peel for garnish.', 'Ricard, Sugar, Peychaud bitters, Water, Bourbon, Lemon peel', 'Fumé, sucré'),
(1202, 'Vesuvio', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into an old-fashioned glass over ice cubes, and serve.', 'Light rum, Sweet Vermouth, Lemon, Powdered sugar, Egg white', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1203, 'Sangria', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix all together in a pitcher and refrigerate. Add cloves and cinnamon sticks to taste. Serve in wine glasses.', 'Red wine, Sugar, Orange juice, Lemon juice, Cloves, Cinnamon', 'Fruité, épicé, sucré, épicé'),
(1204, 'Scooter', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients well with cracked ice, strain into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Brandy, Amaretto, Light cream', 'Fruité'),
(1205, 'Stinger', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour in a mixing glass with ice, stir and strain into a cocktail glass. May also be served on rocks in a rocks glass.', 'Brandy, White Creme de Menthe', 'Herbacé'),
(1206, 'Addison', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake together all the ingredients and strain into a cold glass.', 'Gin, Vermouth', 'Amer'),
(1207, 'Sidecar', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all ingredients into cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake well and strain into cocktail glass.', 'Cognac, Cointreau, Lemon juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1208, 'Paradise', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake together over ice. Strain into cocktail glass and serve chilled.', 'Gin, Apricot Brandy, Orange Juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1209, 'Snowball', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Place one ice cube in the glass and add 1 1/2 oz of Advocaat. Fill up the glass with lemonade and decorate with a slice of lemon. Serve at once.', 'Advocaat, Lemonade, Lemon, Ice', 'Fruité'),
(1210, 'Shot-gun', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour one part Jack Daneils and one part Jim Beam into shot glass then float Wild Turkey on top.', 'Jim Beam, Jack Daniels, Wild Turkey', 'Fruité'),
(1211, 'Gin Sour', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine the gin, lemon juice, and sugar. Shake well. Strain into a sour glass and garnish with the orange slice and the cherry.', 'Gin, Lemon juice, Sugar, Orange, Maraschino cherry', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1212, 'Rum Sour', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine the rum, lemon juice, and sugar. Shake well. Strain into a sour glass and garnish with the orange slice and the cherry.', 'Light rum, Lemon juice, Sugar, Orange, Maraschino cherry', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1213, 'Spice 75', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Gently warm 60g golden caster sugar in a pan with 30ml water and 1 tbsp allspice. Cook gently until the sugar has dissolved, then leave the mixture to cool. Strain through a sieve lined with a coffee filter (or a double layer of kitchen paper).\n\nPour 60ml of the spiced syrup into a cocktail shaker along with 200ml rum and 90ml lime juice. Shake with ice and strain between six flute glasses. Top up with 600ml champagne and garnish each with an orange twist.', 'Sugar, Allspice, Rum, Lime Juice, Champagne, Orange spiral', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1214, 'AT&T', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour Vodka and Gin over ice, add Tonic and Stir', 'Absolut Vodka, Gin, Tonic water', 'Fruité'),
(1215, 'Smut', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Throw it all together and serve real cold.', 'Red wine, Peach schnapps, Pepsi Cola, Orange juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1216, 'Mojito', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Muddle mint leaves with sugar and lime juice. Add a splash of soda water and fill the glass with cracked ice. Pour the rum and top with soda water. Garnish and serve with straw.', 'Light rum, Lime, Sugar, Mint, Soda water', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1217, 'Victor', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Gin, Sweet Vermouth, Brandy', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1218, 'Gimlet', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Add all the ingredients to a shaker and fill with ice.\r\n\r\nShake, and strain into a chilled cocktail glass or an Old Fashioned glass filled with fresh ice.\r\n\r\nGarnish with a lime wheel.', 'Gin, Lime Juice, Sugar Syrup, Lime', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1219, 'Spritz', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Build into glass over ice, garnish and serve.', 'Prosecco, Campari, Soda Water', 'Amer'),
(1220, 'Scooter', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients well with cracked ice, strain into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Brandy, Amaretto, Light cream', 'Fruité'),
(1221, 'Quentin', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine the rum, Kahlua, and cream. Shake well. Strain into a cocktail glass and garnish with the nutmeg.', 'Dark rum, Kahlua, Light cream, Nutmeg', 'Fruité, épicé, épicé'),
(1222, 'Martini', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Straight: Pour all ingredients into mixing glass with ice cubes. Stir well. Strain in chilled martini cocktail glass. Squeeze oil from lemon peel onto the drink, or garnish with olive.', 'Gin, Dry Vermouth, Olive', 'Amer, salé, salé'),
(1223, 'Mai Tai', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice. Strain into glass. Garnish and serve with straw.', 'Light rum, Orgeat syrup, Triple sec, Sweet and sour, Cherry', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1224, 'Veteran', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour the rum and cherry brandy into an old-fashioned glass almost filled with ice cubes. Stir well.', 'Dark rum, Cherry brandy', 'Fruité'),
(1225, 'Stinger', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour in a mixing glass with ice, stir and strain into a cocktail glass. May also be served on rocks in a rocks glass.', 'Brandy, White Creme de Menthe', 'Herbacé'),
(1226, 'Affinity', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a mixing glass half-filled with ice cubes, combine all of the ingredients. Stir well. Strain into a cocktail glass.', 'Scotch, Sweet Vermouth, Dry Vermouth, Orange bitters', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1227, 'Shot-gun', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour one part Jack Daneils and one part Jim Beam into shot glass then float Wild Turkey on top.', 'Jim Beam, Jack Daniels, Wild Turkey', 'Fruité'),
(1228, 'Aviation', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Add all ingredients into cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake well and strain into cocktail glass. Garnish with a cherry.', 'Gin, lemon juice, maraschino liqueur', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1229, 'Thriller', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine all of the ingredients. Shake well. Strain into a cocktail glass.', 'Scotch, Wine, Orange juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1230, 'Jam Donut', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'Coat the rim of a shot glass with sugar using sugar syrup to stick. Add the Chambord raspberry liqueur to the shot glass, and carefully layer the Baileys Irish Cream on top. Serve.', 'Baileys irish cream, Chambord raspberry liqueur, Sugar syrup, Sugar', 'Crémeux, sucré, sucré'),
(1231, 'Manhattan', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Stirred over ice, strained into a chilled glass, garnished, and served up.', 'Sweet Vermouth, Bourbon, Angostura bitters, Ice, Maraschino cherry, Orange peel', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1232, 'Salty Dog', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all ingredients over ice cubes in a highball glass. Stir well and serve. (Vodka may be substituted for gin, if preferred.)', 'Grapefruit juice, Gin, Salt', 'Fruité, sucré, salé'),
(1233, 'Artillery', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Stir all ingredients with ice, strain into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Sweet Vermouth, Gin, Bitters', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1234, 'Jitterbug', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Wet glass, dip rim in sugar. Then add Ice. Then add everything else. It\'s that simple!', 'Gin, Vodka, Grenadine, Lime juice, Sugar, Sugar syrup, Soda water', 'Acide, sucré, sucré'),
(1235, 'Zorbatini', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Prepare like a Martini. Garnish with a green olive.', 'Vodka, Ouzo', 'Fruité'),
(1236, 'Afterglow', 'Cocktail', 'Non alcoholic', 'Mix. Serve over ice.', 'Grenadine, Orange juice, Pineapple juice', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1237, 'Rum Toddy', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Dissolve powdered sugar in water in an old-fashioned glass. Add rum and one ice cube and stir. Add the twist of lemon peel and serve.', 'Rum, Powdered sugar, Lemon peel, Water', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1238, 'Tia-Maria', 'Homemade Liqueur', 'Alcoholic', 'Boil water, sugar and coffe for 10 mins and let cool. Add rum and vanilla. Put in clean bottle(s) and leave for 1 week before using.', 'Water, Brown sugar, Coffee, Rum, Vanilla extract', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1239, 'Smut', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Throw it all together and serve real cold.', 'Red wine, Peach schnapps, Pepsi Cola, Orange juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1240, 'Bijou', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Stir in mixing glass with ice and strain\r\n', 'Orange Bitters, Green Chartreuse, Gin, Sweet Vermouth', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1241, 'Quentin', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine the rum, Kahlua, and cream. Shake well. Strain into a cocktail glass and garnish with the nutmeg.', 'Dark rum, Kahlua, Light cream, Nutmeg', 'Fruité, épicé, épicé'),
(1242, 'Vesuvio', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into an old-fashioned glass over ice cubes, and serve.', 'Light rum, Sweet Vermouth, Lemon, Powdered sugar, Egg white', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1243, 'Daiquiri', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all ingredients into shaker with ice cubes. Shake well. Strain in chilled cocktail glass.', 'Light rum, Lime, Powdered sugar', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1244, 'Gin Sour', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine the gin, lemon juice, and sugar. Shake well. Strain into a sour glass and garnish with the orange slice and the cherry.', 'Gin, Lemon juice, Sugar, Orange, Maraschino cherry', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1245, 'Rum Sour', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine the rum, lemon juice, and sugar. Shake well. Strain into a sour glass and garnish with the orange slice and the cherry.', 'Light rum, Lemon juice, Sugar, Orange, Maraschino cherry', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1246, 'Bluebird', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a mixing glass half-filled with crushed ice, combine the gin, triple sec, Curacao, and bitters. Stir well. Strain into a cocktail glass and garnish with the lemon twist and the cherry.', 'Gin, Triple sec, Blue Curacao, Bitters, Maraschino cherry, Lemon peel', 'Fruité'),
(1247, '501 Blue', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix equal amounts into a glass with ice.', 'Blue Curacao, Blueberry schnapps, Vodka, Sour mix, 7-Up', 'Fruité'),
(1248, 'Acapulco', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Combine and shake all ingredients (except mint) with ice and strain into an old-fashioned glass over ice cubes. Add the sprig of mint and serve.', 'Light rum, Triple sec, Lime juice, Sugar, Egg white, Mint', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1249, 'Shot-gun', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour one part Jack Daneils and one part Jim Beam into shot glass then float Wild Turkey on top.', 'Jim Beam, Jack Daniels, Wild Turkey', 'Fruité'),
(1250, 'Buccaneer', 'Beer', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour the corona into an 18oz beer glass pour the bacardi limon into the beer stir very gently', 'Corona, Bacardi Limon', 'Fruité'),
(1251, 'Rum Punch', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix all ingredients in a punch bowl and serve.', 'Rum, Ginger ale, Fruit punch, Orange juice, Ice', 'Fruité, épicé, sucré, épicé'),
(1252, 'Algonquin', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Combine and shake all ingredients with ice, strain contents into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Blended whiskey, Dry Vermouth, Pineapple juice', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1253, 'Rum Toddy', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Dissolve powdered sugar in water in an old-fashioned glass. Add rum and one ice cube and stir. Add the twist of lemon peel and serve.', 'Rum, Powdered sugar, Lemon peel, Water', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1254, 'Autodafé', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix and fill up with soda water. Drunk by finns on a sunny day any time of the year and day.', 'Vodka, Lime juice, Soda water', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1255, 'Lunch Box', 'Beer', 'Alcoholic', 'Fill a pint glass almost full with beer. Then fill the rest with orange juice (careful not to fill it to the top). Then take the shot of Amaretto and drop it in.', 'Beer, Amaretto, Orange juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1256, 'Greyhound', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Add the vodka to a Collins glass filled with ice.\nTop with grapefruit juice and stir.\n\n', 'Vodka, Grapefruit Juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1257, 'Gluehwein', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Optional alcohol', 'Boil sugar and spices in water, leave in the water for 30 minutes. Strain the spiced water and mix with the wine. Heat slowly until short of boiling temperature. (To remove alcohol, let it boil for a while.) You may add lemon or orange juice to taste. Serve in irish coffee cup.', 'Red wine, Water, Sugar, Cinnamon, Cloves, Lemon peel', 'Fruité, épicé, sucré, épicé'),
(1258, 'Jam Donut', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'Coat the rim of a shot glass with sugar using sugar syrup to stick. Add the Chambord raspberry liqueur to the shot glass, and carefully layer the Baileys Irish Cream on top. Serve.', 'Baileys irish cream, Chambord raspberry liqueur, Sugar syrup, Sugar', 'Crémeux, sucré, sucré'),
(1259, 'Mauresque', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', '1 - Pour the Ricard (or pastis)\n2 - Pour the orgeat syrup\n3 - Finally pour the water and add ice cubes at your convenience.\n\nAdd the ice cubes at the end, otherwise the syrup and pastis do not mix well.', 'Ricard, Orgeat Syrup, Water', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1260, 'Barracuda', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake pour ingredients with ice. Strain into glass, top with Sparkling wine.', 'Rum, Galliano, Pineapple Juice, Lime Juice, Prosecco', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1261, 'Old Cuban', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake a handful of mint, 2oz white rum, 1oz of sugar syrup, 1oz lime juice and 2 dashes angostura bitters with ice. Double strain into a glass and top with 2oz of prosecco.', 'White Rum, Sugar Syrup, Lime Juice, Angostura Bitters, Prosecco', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1262, 'Jitterbug', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Wet glass, dip rim in sugar. Then add Ice. Then add everything else. It\'s that simple!', 'Gin, Vodka, Grenadine, Lime juice, Sugar, Sugar syrup, Soda water', 'Acide, sucré, sucré'),
(1263, 'Queen Bee', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Coffee brandy, Lime vodka, Sherry', 'Acide'),
(1264, 'Vesper', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake over ice until well chilled, then strain into a deep goblet and garnish with a thin slice of lemon peel.', 'Gin, Vodka, Lillet Blanc', 'Fruité'),
(1265, 'Victor', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Gin, Sweet Vermouth, Brandy', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1266, 'Avalon', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Fill a tall glass with ice. Layer the Finlandia Vodka, lemon and apple juices, Pisang Ambon, and top up with lemonade. Stir slightly and garnish with a spiralled cucumber skin and a red cherry. The cucumber provides zest and looks attractive. This drink, created by Timo Haimi, took first prize in the 1991 Finlandia Vodka Long Drink Competition.', 'Vodka, Pisang Ambon, Apple juice, Lemon juice, Lemonade', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1267, 'Vesuvio', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into an old-fashioned glass over ice cubes, and serve.', 'Light rum, Sweet Vermouth, Lemon, Powdered sugar, Egg white', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1268, 'Veteran', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour the rum and cherry brandy into an old-fashioned glass almost filled with ice cubes. Stir well.', 'Dark rum, Cherry brandy', 'Fruité'),
(1269, 'Vampiro', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Vampiros may be made in a tall glass or an old fashioned glass. Bartenders may first \"rim\" the glass with Kosher Salt, which is done by placing a layer of Kosher Salt on a chopping board, moistening the glass\' rim with lime juice or water, and then placing the upside down glass rim onto the Kosher Salt, so that the salt sticks to the moistened rim. The second step is to fill half the glass with ice and add one or two shooter glasses full of high quality Tequila. The next stage is to add the flavouring elements. This is done by squeezing a fresh lime into the glass, adding a few grains of salt, adding citrus-flavoured soda pop, until the glass is 4/5 full, and then adding spicy Viuda de Sanchez (or orange juice, lime juice and pico de gallo). The final step is to stir the ingredients so that the flavours are properly blended.', 'Tequila, Tomato Juice, Orange Juice, Lime Juice, Sugar Syrup, Salt', 'Acide, sucré, salé'),
(1270, 'Aviation', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Add all ingredients into cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake well and strain into cocktail glass. Garnish with a cherry.', 'Gin, lemon juice, maraschino liqueur', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1271, 'Van Vleet', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into an old-fashioned glass over ice cubes, and serve.', 'Light rum, Maple syrup, Lemon juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1272, 'Avalanche', 'Shake', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix in highball glass over ice, shake well.', 'Crown Royal, Kahlua, Cream', 'Fruité'),
(1273, 'Vodka Fizz', 'Other / Unknown', 'Alcoholic', 'Blend all ingredients, save nutmeg. Pour into large white wine glass and sprinkle nutmeg on top.', 'Vodka, Half-and-half, Limeade, Ice, Nutmeg', 'Acide, épicé, épicé'),
(1274, 'Adam & Eve', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake together all the ingredients and strain into a cold glass.', 'Gin, Cognac, Creme de Cassis, Fresh Lemon Juice', 'Crémeux, sucré'),
(1275, 'Cafe Savoy', 'Coffee / Tea', 'Alcoholic', 'Fill mug almost to top with coffee.Add milk, triple sec and brandy. Stir.', 'Coffee, Milk, Triple sec, Brandy', 'Fruité'),
(1276, 'Long vodka', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake a tall glass with ice cubes and Angostura, coating the inside of the glass. Por the vodka onto this, add 1 slice of lime and squeeze juice out of remainder, mix with tonic, stir and voila you have a Long Vodka', 'Vodka, Lime, Angostura bitters, Tonic water, Ice', 'Acide'),
(1277, 'After Five', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', '1. Pour Kahlua into shot glass to about 1/2 full. 2. Using a spoon(inverted), slowly pour in the Peppermint Schnapps until glass is about 3/4 full. Done correctly, the Schnapps will flow under the Kahlua for a clear layer. 3. Again using a spoon, but this time right side up, slowly top off the glass with a layer of Bailey\'s. Be careful to place the spoon right at the top of the Kahlua layer and to raise it as the glass fills up. Done correctly, this will provide a layer of Bailey\'s floating over the Kahlua. 4. Toss it down all at once for something like a Peppermint Pattie, WITH A BANG!!! NOTE: Best if all ingredients are chilled', 'Peppermint schnapps, Kahlua, Baileys irish cream', 'Crémeux, épicé'),
(1278, 'Miami Vice', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'First: Mix pina colada with 2.5 oz. of rum with ice(set aside). Second: Mix daiquiri with 2.5 oz. of rum with ice. Third: While frozen, add pina colda mix then daiquiri mix in glass (Making sure they do not get mixed together).', '151 proof rum, Pina colada mix, Daiquiri mix', 'Fruité'),
(1279, 'Vodka Slime', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Fill glass with ice. Add vodka, 7-up then finish with the lime juice.', 'Sprite, Lime Juice, Vodka', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1280, 'Vodka Tonic', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Wash and cut 1 wedge and 1 slice of lime or lemon.\r\nFill a tumbler with fresh ice.\r\nPour the desired dose of vodka and top up with the tonic.\r\nSqueeze the lime wedge into the glass and decorate with the slice.\r\nThat\'s all, very simple: it\'s just the recipe for happiness!', 'Vodka, Tonic Water, Lemon Peel', 'Fruité');
INSERT INTO `cocktails` (`id`, `name`, `category`, `alcoholic`, `instructions`, `ingredients`, `flavor`) VALUES
(1281, 'Vodka Lemon', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'The vodka lemon is prepared directly in a highball glass or in a large tumbler: put 6-7 ice cubes in the glass, pour the vodka, lemonade and mix with a bar spoon. Finally decorate with a slice of lemon and, if you prefer, add a few mint leaves. Your vodka lemon is ready to be served.', 'Vodka, Lemon Juice, Lemon Peel, Ice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1282, 'Screwdriver', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix in a highball glass with ice. Garnish and serve.', 'Vodka, Orange juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1283, 'Clover Club', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Dry shake ingredients to emulsify, add ice, shake and served straight up.', 'Gin, Grenadine, Lemon, Egg white', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1284, 'Boulevardier', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Stir with ice, strain, garnish and serve.', 'Campari, Sweet Vermouth, Rye whiskey, Orange Peel', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1285, 'Coffee-Vodka', 'Homemade Liqueur', 'Alcoholic', 'Boil water and sugar until dissolved. Turn off heat. Slowly add dry instant coffee and continue stirring. Add a chopped vanilla bean to the vodka, then combine the cooled sugar syrup and coffee solution with the vodka. Cover tightly and shake vigorously each day for 3 weeks. Strain and filter. Its also best to let the sugar mixture cool completely so the vodka won\'t evaporate when its added. If you like a smoother feel to the liqueur you can add about 1 teaspoon of glycerine to the finished product.', 'Water, Sugar, Coffee, Vanilla, Vodka, Caramel coloring', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1286, 'Arise My Love', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Put creme de menthe into a champagne flute. Fill with chilled champagne and serve.', 'Champagne, Green Creme de Menthe', 'Herbacé'),
(1287, 'Vodka Russian', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix it as a ordinary drink .', 'Vodka, Schweppes Russchian', 'Fruité'),
(1288, 'Vodka Martini', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake the vodka and vermouth together with a number of ice cubes, strain into a cocktail glass, add the olive and serve.', 'Vodka, Dry Vermouth, Olive', 'Amer, salé, salé'),
(1289, 'Snowday', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Stir all ingredients with ice. Strain into a chilled rocks glass over fresh ice. Express orange peel over drink and garnish.', 'Vodka, Amaro Montenegro, Ruby Port, Blood Orange, Angostura Bitters, Orange Peel', 'Amer'),
(1290, 'Snowball', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Place one ice cube in the glass and add 1 1/2 oz of Advocaat. Fill up the glass with lemonade and decorate with a slice of lemon. Serve at once.', 'Advocaat, Lemonade, Lemon, Ice', 'Fruité'),
(1291, 'Downshift', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Start with the Sprite. Next comes the tequila. After that, add the Minute Maid Fruit Punch, then float the 151. Rocks optional.', 'Fruit punch, Sprite, Tequila, 151 proof rum', 'Fruité'),
(1292, 'Afterglow', 'Cocktail', 'Non alcoholic', 'Mix. Serve over ice.', 'Grenadine, Orange juice, Pineapple juice', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1293, 'Gluehwein', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Optional alcohol', 'Boil sugar and spices in water, leave in the water for 30 minutes. Strain the spiced water and mix with the wine. Heat slowly until short of boiling temperature. (To remove alcohol, let it boil for a while.) You may add lemon or orange juice to taste. Serve in irish coffee cup.', 'Red wine, Water, Sugar, Cinnamon, Cloves, Lemon peel', 'Fruité, épicé, sucré, épicé'),
(1294, 'White Lady', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Add all ingredients into cocktail shaker filled with ice. Shake well and strain into large cocktail glass.', 'Gin, Triple Sec, Lemon Juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1295, 'Kiwi Lemon', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix in highball glass. Stirr. Garnish with slice of kiwi.', 'Kiwi liqueur, Bitter lemon, Ice', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1296, 'Wine Punch', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Combine all of the ingredients and pour over a block of ice.', 'Red wine, Lemon, Orange juice, Orange, Pineapple juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1297, 'Whisky Mac', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour both of the ingredients into a wine goblet with no ice.', 'Scotch, Wine', 'Fruité'),
(1298, '3 Wise Men', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'put them them in a glass... and slam it to tha head.', 'Jack Daniels, Johnnie Walker, Jim Beam', 'Fruité'),
(1299, 'Moscow Mule', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Combine vodka and ginger beer in a highball glass filled with ice. Add lime juice. Stir gently. Garnish.', 'Vodka, Lime juice, Ginger ale', 'Acide, épicé, sucré, épicé'),
(1300, 'Gin Swizzle', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine the lime juice, sugar, gin, and bitters. Shake well. Almost fill a colling glass with ice cubes. Stir until the glass is frosted. Strain the mixture in the shaker into the glass and add the club soda.', 'Lime juice, Sugar, Gin, Bitters, Club soda', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1301, 'Yellow Bird', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake and strain into a chilled cocktail glass', 'White Rum, Galliano, Triple Sec, Lime Juice', 'Acide, sucré'),
(1302, 'London Town', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a mixing glass half-filled with ice cubes, combine all of the ingredients. Stir well. Strain into a cocktail glass.', 'Gin, Maraschino liqueur, Orange bitters', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1303, 'Orange Whip', 'Other / Unknown', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour ingredients over ice and stir.', 'Orange juice, Rum, Vodka, Cream, Ice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1304, 'Sweet Tooth', 'Shake', 'Alcoholic', 'Put 2 shots Godiva Liquour into a glass, add as much or as little milk as you would like.', 'Godiva liqueur, Milk', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1305, 'Screwdriver', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix in a highball glass with ice. Garnish and serve.', 'Vodka, Orange juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1306, 'Mulled Wine', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Simmer 3 cups water with, sugar, cloves, cinnamon sticks, and lemon peel in a stainless steel pot for 10 minutes. Add wine heat to a \"coffee temperature\" (DO NOT BOIL) then add the brandy.', 'Water, Sugar, Cloves, Cinnamon, Lemon peel, Red wine, Brandy', 'Fruité, épicé, sucré, épicé'),
(1307, 'Wine Cooler', 'Punch / Party Drink', 'Optional alcohol', 'Mix wine and soft drink. Pour into glass. Add ice.', 'Red wine, Lemon-lime soda, Ice', 'Acide'),
(1308, 'Winter Rita', 'Beer', 'Alcoholic', 'Salt rim. Combine all ingredients, shake with ice, and strain over fresh ice.⠀', 'Tequila, Campari, Lime Juice, Orange Juice, Rosemary Syrup, Salt', 'Acide, sucré, salé'),
(1309, '9 1/2 Weeks', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Combine all ingredients in glass mixer. Chill and strain into Cocktail glass. Garnish with sliced strawberry.', 'Absolut Citron, Orange Curacao, Strawberry liqueur, Orange juice', 'Acide, sucré, sucré'),
(1310, 'Whiskey Sour', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake with ice. Strain into chilled glass, garnish and serve. If served \'On the rocks\', strain ingredients into old-fashioned glass filled with ice.', 'Blended whiskey, Lemon, Powdered sugar, Cherry, Lemon', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1311, 'Kiwi Martini', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'The kiwi martini is a very fun vodka cocktail and it is one of the best drinks that makes use of fresh fruit. Though there are a few recipes floating around, this is one of the easiest and it is an absolutely delightful green martini to drink.\n\nFor this recipe, you\'ll simply muddle slices of kiwi with simple syrup, then shake it with vodka. It\'s a drink that anyone can mix up in minutes and a perfect cocktail to show off your favorite vodka.', 'Kiwi, Sugar Syrup, Vodka, Kiwi', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1312, 'Monkey Wrench', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all of the ingredients into an old-fashioned glass almost filled with ice cubes. Stir well.', 'Light rum, Grapefruit juice, Bitters', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1313, 'New York Sour', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake blended whiskey, juice of lemon, and powdered sugar with ice and strain into a whiskey sour glass. Float claret on top. Decorate with the half-slice of lemon and the cherry and serve.', 'Blended whiskey, Lemon, Sugar, Red wine, Lemon, Cherry', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1314, 'Boxcar', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine all of the ingredients. Shake well. Strain into a sour glass.', 'Gin, Triple sec, Lemon juice, Grenadine, Egg white', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1315, 'Alexander', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice and strain contents into a cocktail glass. Sprinkle nutmeg on top and serve.', 'Gin, Creme de Cacao, Light cream, Nutmeg', 'Crémeux, épicé, épicé'),
(1316, 'Foxy Lady', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into a chilled cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Amaretto, Creme de Cacao, Light cream', 'Crémeux'),
(1317, 'Lunch Box', 'Beer', 'Alcoholic', 'Fill a pint glass almost full with beer. Then fill the rest with orange juice (careful not to fill it to the top). Then take the shot of Amaretto and drop it in.', 'Beer, Amaretto, Orange juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1318, 'After sex', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour the vodka and creme over some ice cubes in a tall glass and fill up with juice. to make it beuty full make the top of the glass with a grenadine and sugar', 'Vodka, Creme de Banane, Orange juice', 'Crémeux, sucré'),
(1319, 'Absolut Sex', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake Absolut Kurant, Midori, and Cranberry juice in shaker with ice: Strain into rocks glass: Splash of seven on top.Absolut Sex.', 'Absolut Kurant, Midori melon liqueur, Cranberry juice, Sprite', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1320, 'Texas Sling', 'Shake', 'Alcoholic', 'Blend with Ice until smooth. Serve in a tulip glass, top with whip cream.', 'Kahlua, Irish cream, Amaretto, 151 proof rum, Cream', 'Fruité'),
(1321, 'Mojito Extra', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Put mint with lemon juice in a glas, mash the mint with a spoon, ice, rum & fill up with club soda. Top it with Angostura.', 'Mint, Lemon juice, Dark rum, Club soda, Angostura bitters', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1322, 'Midnight Manx', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Fill a mixer with ice and add Baileys, Kahlua, Goldshlager, and cream. Shake for 5 seconds and Strain into a double rocks glass filled with ice. Add chilled coffee Stir and enjoy!', 'Kahlua, Baileys irish cream, Goldschlager, Heavy cream, Coffee', 'Crémeux'),
(1323, 'Tuxedo Cocktail', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Stir all ingredients with ice and strain into a cocktail glass. Garnish with a cherry and a twist of lemon zest.', 'Dry Vermouth, Gin, Maraschino liqueur, Anis, Orange bitters, Cherry', 'Amer, sucré, sucré'),
(1324, 'Brandy Alexander', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients (except nutmeg) with ice and strain contents into a cocktail glass. Sprinkle nutmeg on top and serve.', 'Brandy, Creme de Cacao, Light cream, Nutmeg', 'Crémeux, épicé, épicé'),
(1325, 'Sex on the Beach', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Build all ingredients in a highball glass filled with ice. Garnish with orange slice.', 'Vodka, Peach schnapps, Cranberry juice, Orange juice', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1326, 'Texas Rattlesnake', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'Mix all ingredients and Shake well. Sweet at first, with a BITE at the end...', 'Yukon Jack, Cherry brandy, Southern Comfort, Sweet and sour', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1327, 'Melya', 'Coffee / Tea', 'Non alcoholic', 'Brew espresso. In a coffee mug, place 1 teaspoon of unsweetened powdered cocoa, then cover a teaspoon with honey and drizzle it into the cup. Stir while the coffee brews, this is the fun part. The cocoa seems to coat the honey without mixing, so you get a dusty, sticky mass that looks as though it will never mix. Then all at once, presto! It looks like dark chocolate sauce. Pour hot espresso over the honey, stirring to dissolve. Serve with cream.', 'Espresso, Honey, Cocoa powder', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1328, 'Derby', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Pour all ingredients into a mixing glass with ice. Stir. Strain into a cocktail glass. Garnish with a sprig of fresh mint in the drink.', 'gin, Peach Bitters, Mint', 'Fruité'),
(1329, 'Snowday', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Stir all ingredients with ice. Strain into a chilled rocks glass over fresh ice. Express orange peel over drink and garnish.', 'Vodka, Amaro Montenegro, Ruby Port, Blood Orange, Angostura Bitters, Orange Peel', 'Amer'),
(1330, 'Brooklyn', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Combine ingredients with ice and stir until well-chilled. Strain into a chilled cocktail glass.', 'Rye Whiskey, Dry Vermouth, Maraschino Liqueur, Angostura Bitters, Maraschino Cherry', 'Amer, sucré, sucré'),
(1331, 'Affinity', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a mixing glass half-filled with ice cubes, combine all of the ingredients. Stir well. Strain into a cocktail glass.', 'Scotch, Sweet Vermouth, Dry Vermouth, Orange bitters', 'Amer, sucré'),
(1332, 'Allegheny', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients (except lemon peel) with ice and strain into a cocktail glass. Top with the twist of lemon peel and serve.', 'Dry Vermouth, Bourbon, Blackberry brandy, Lemon juice, Lemon peel', 'Amer, sucré'),
