(1337, 'Tipperary', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Stir over ice. Strain into chilled glass. Cut a wide swath of orange peel, and express the orange oils over the drink. Discard orange twist.', 'Irish Whiskey, Sweet Vermouth, Green Chartreuse', 'Amer, sucré'),
