(1343, 'Rum Toddy', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Dissolve powdered sugar in water in an old-fashioned glass. Add rum and one ice cube and stir. Add the twist of lemon peel and serve.', 'Rum, Powdered sugar, Lemon peel, Water', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1344, 'Hot Toddy', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'STEP 1\r\nWhisk the whisky and honey together and split between 2 heatproof glasses. Add half of the cinnamon stick to each, then top up with 200ml boiling water.\r\n\r\nSTEP 2\r\nAdd a splash of lemon juice to each, then taste and add more to your preference. Finish each with a slice of lemon, studded with a clove, and serve immediately.', 'Whiskey, Honey, Cinnamon, lemon, Cloves', 'Fruité, épicé, sucré, épicé'),
(1345, 'Bob Marley', 'Shot', 'Alcoholic', 'Layer in a 2 oz shot glass or pony glass', 'Midori melon liqueur, Jägermeister, Goldschlager', 'Fruité, sucré, sucré'),
(1346, 'Almond Joy', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients with ice, strain into a cocktail glass, and serve.', 'Amaretto, Creme de Cacao, Light cream', 'Crémeux'),
