(1363, 'Royal Fizz', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'Shake all ingredients (except cola) with ice and strain into a chilled collins glass. Fill with cola and serve.', 'Gin, Sweet and sour, Egg, Coca-Cola', 'Fruité, sucré'),
(1364, 'Martinez 2', 'Cocktail', 'Alcoholic', 'Add all ingredients to a mixing glass and fill with ice.\r\n\r\nStir until chilled, and strain into a chilled coupe glass.', 'Gin, Sweet Vermouth, Maraschino Liqueur, Angostura Bitters', 'Amer, sucré, sucré'),
