(1368, 'Gin Swizzle', 'Ordinary Drink', 'Alcoholic', 'In a shaker half-filled with ice cubes, combine the lime juice, sugar, gin, and bitters. Shake well. Almost fill a colling glass with ice cubes. Stir until the glass is frosted. Strain the mixture in the shaker into the glass and add the club soda.', 'Lime juice, Sugar, Gin, Bitters, Club soda', 'Acide, sucré'),
