(1376, 'Fuzzy Asshole', 'Coffee / Tea', 'Alcoholic', 'fill coffe mug half full of coffee. Fill the other half full of Peach Schnapps. Stir and drink while hot.', 'Coffee, Peach schnapps', 'Fruité');
